/P 125 0 R
/E ( Hi everyone! My name is Rosa Carmela and I'm this year's Junior VP of sponsorship. I'm currently in my third year studying animal biology at the University of Guelph while also doing a minor in neuroscience. Throughout my time in university, I have learned so much about myself, the way I study, and new things that I never thought would interest me. I knew going into University that I loved all things science-related, but I was also aware of my passion for helping animals, which is why I felt animal biology would be a wonderful start to working towards a career goal of mine to assist with animals' behaviours, health, and well-being.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
