/P 126 0 R
/E ( My advice to pre-vet students is to never stop learning because it is a gift and we are fortunate to be given the opportunity to chase our dreams. It is also so important to always be proud of yourself and to never give up! As much as we all want to be perfect, we need to understand that we can only do what we can do, and as long as you try, you can do no wrong. If anyone would like to reach out and chat, I am always here, and if you ever want to talk about something Star Wars related, you know who to call :\) All the best with your future endeavours <3)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
