/E (The Path to Vet School workshop is designed to guide students through the journey of pursuing a career in veterinary medicine. It covers key steps such as prerequisite courses, gaining animal and veterinary experience, building a strong application, and preparing for interviews. Attendees also gain insight into what veterinary schools look for in applicants, along with tips from current students or professionals about navigating the process and standing out in a competitive field.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [6]
>>
