/P 127 0 R
/E (The Gaining Veterinary Experience Workshop is designed to help students understand how to build meaningful and diverse experience for a career in veterinary medicine. It highlights different opportunities, such as working or volunteering in clinics, farms, research labs, and animal shelters, and provides tips on how to find positions, approach clinics, and make the most of each experience. Attendees also learn what veterinary schools look for, including hands-on skills, animal handling, and strong communication, and how to showcase these experiences effectively in applications.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
